WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.264
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.534 --> 00:22.869
(Firefly Theater)

3
00:43.456 --> 00:47.392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

4
00:49.024 --> 00:52.608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

5
00:53.184 --> 00:55.520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

6
00:55.904 --> 00:58.656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

7
00:59.488 --> 01:02.080
♪I've seen this game before♪

8
01:02.080 --> 01:04.768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

9
01:04.768 --> 01:07.168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

10
01:07.552 --> 01:10.304
♪Just an empty shell♪

11
01:10.624 --> 01:13.440
♪I've broken this game before♪

12
01:13.440 --> 01:15.872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

13
01:15.872 --> 01:18.016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

14
01:18.208 --> 01:25.056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

15
01:25.728 --> 01:28.256
♪When I stand back up again♪

16
01:28.544 --> 01:30.400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

17
01:31.264 --> 01:33.952
♪For the part you owe me♪

18
01:34.112 --> 01:41.088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

19
01:42.624 --> 01:47.360
♪You're just my starting point♪

20
01:51.712 --> 01:52.739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

21
01:53.128 --> 01:55.720
=Episode 16=

22
01:58.091 --> 01:59.052
What's for dinner?

23
01:59.451 --> 02:00.371
- Anything's fine. - Mr. Jiao.

24
02:00.572 --> 02:01.212
Whatever works.

25
02:03.611 --> 02:04.212
Honey.

26
02:04.731 --> 02:05.572
Why are you here?

27
02:06.891 --> 02:08.412
Helping a friend shoot a video.

28
02:10.532 --> 02:11.292
Mr. Jiao,

29
02:11.572 --> 02:12.171
we meet again.

30
02:12.211 --> 02:12.931
Seeking legal help

31
02:12.972 --> 02:13.812
again, Mr. Di?

32
02:14.572 --> 02:16.132
Feels like your company is always

33
02:16.171 --> 02:17.171
running into trouble.

34
02:17.412 --> 02:18.252
Just bad luck lately.

35
02:20.132 --> 02:21.211
What Liu Bai did

36
02:21.252 --> 02:22.451
really surprised me.

37
02:22.771 --> 02:23.651
The police said

38
02:23.931 --> 02:24.771
he even hired people

39
02:25.012 --> 02:26.132
to troll online,

40
02:26.491 --> 02:27.611
claiming I abused you.

41
02:28.211 --> 02:28.852
How did he

42
02:28.891 --> 02:29.812
turn out this way?

43
02:30.211 --> 02:30.931
Honestly,

44
02:31.572 --> 02:32.532
I want to be nice.

45
02:33.211 --> 02:34.891
He's Liu Zi's brother, after all.

46
02:34.891 --> 02:35.651
But

47
02:36.491 --> 02:37.372
blackmail

48
02:37.491 --> 02:39.170
and extortion are serious crimes.

49
02:39.331 --> 02:40.132
Plus, Han Guang

50
02:40.171 --> 02:41.171
is pressuring me.

51
02:41.572 --> 02:42.651
I have no choice.

52
02:42.931 --> 02:43.532
Mr. Di,

53
02:44.331 --> 02:46.292
let's talk about details inside.

54
02:46.972 --> 02:47.372
Sure.

55
02:47.651 --> 02:48.092
After you.

56
02:50.572 --> 02:51.532
Let's talk at home.

57
02:58.812 --> 03:00.331
Is his lawyer any good?

58
03:01.051 --> 03:01.731
He is

59
03:01.731 --> 03:02.891
the top dog in this field.

60
03:13.132 --> 03:14.292
I can recommend good lawyers

61
03:14.372 --> 03:15.012
to you.

62
03:15.532 --> 03:16.412
I've looked into it.

63
03:16.692 --> 03:17.412
Liu Bai

64
03:17.572 --> 03:18.651
can get bail.

65
03:18.972 --> 03:19.852
If you need it...

66
03:20.252 --> 03:20.931
I do.

67
03:21.211 --> 03:22.171
I know Liu Bai.

68
03:22.611 --> 03:23.891
I don't think he'd do that.

69
03:29.931 --> 03:30.451
What's up?

70
03:31.491 --> 03:32.532
My boss is calling me.

71
03:32.812 --> 03:33.972
I feel something's up.

72
03:34.891 --> 03:36.012
Can you do me a favor?

73
03:36.451 --> 03:37.292
First, get the lawyer

74
03:37.292 --> 03:38.611
to file a jurisdiction objection.

75
03:38.771 --> 03:39.651
Then bring up

76
03:39.692 --> 03:40.771
his no Jiangzhou residency

77
03:40.891 --> 03:42.252
and push for venue transfer

78
03:42.292 --> 03:43.532
to his registered address court

79
03:43.532 --> 03:44.292
for trial.

80
03:44.572 --> 03:45.372
Once you apply,

81
03:45.572 --> 03:46.731
the hearing will be put off.

82
03:46.852 --> 03:48.532
Won't teaching me like this

83
03:48.572 --> 03:50.572
get you in trouble for ethics violations?

84
03:50.852 --> 03:51.972
Di Liren sued Liu Bai.

85
03:52.012 --> 03:53.051
Zi's the related party.

86
03:53.051 --> 03:53.931
You're not involved.

87
03:54.121 --> 03:55.532
I'm discussing a hypothetical case

88
03:55.572 --> 03:57.171
that happens to share the same names,

89
03:57.731 --> 03:58.611
so what's the harm?

90
04:00.491 --> 04:01.451
You want

91
04:01.532 --> 04:03.611
to drive up Di Liren's legal costs, both in time

92
04:03.651 --> 04:04.451
and money.

93
04:05.292 --> 04:06.532
What if he digs his heels in

94
04:06.572 --> 04:07.572
just to lock Liu Bai up?

95
04:07.891 --> 04:08.292
He won't.

96
04:08.372 --> 04:09.412
He's way more stressed.

97
04:09.891 --> 04:10.651
He has to fix this

98
04:10.651 --> 04:11.812
before Jinghua officially

99
04:11.812 --> 04:12.812
hits the market.

100
04:13.931 --> 04:14.611
And his

101
04:14.651 --> 04:15.451
biggest mistake is

102
04:15.491 --> 04:16.331
he hired Mr. Chen.

103
04:16.612 --> 04:17.732
Didn't you say Mr. Chen

104
04:17.851 --> 04:19.252
is the top lawyer in this field?

105
04:19.771 --> 04:20.932
Mr. Chen is too seasoned.

106
04:20.971 --> 04:22.211
He'll quickly spot the holes

107
04:22.252 --> 04:23.451
in Di Liren's story.

108
04:24.132 --> 04:25.132
So your real target

109
04:25.172 --> 04:26.052
isn't Di Liren,

110
04:26.451 --> 04:27.252
but Mr. Chen.

111
04:27.612 --> 04:28.572
Mr. Chen's usual cases

112
04:28.612 --> 04:29.451
are worth millions,

113
04:29.492 --> 04:31.012
even tens of millions.

114
04:31.132 --> 04:32.451
Taking Di Liren's case was purely

115
04:32.492 --> 04:33.492
as a personal favor.

116
04:33.891 --> 04:35.531
That's why we challenge jurisdiction,

117
04:35.572 --> 04:36.492
forcing him to travel

118
04:36.531 --> 04:37.612
across provinces.

119
04:38.612 --> 04:40.052
I have a million other ways

120
04:40.052 --> 04:41.012
to delay the trial,

121
04:41.132 --> 04:42.291
making him travel all the way

122
04:42.291 --> 04:43.145
for nothing.

123
04:43.372 --> 04:43.891
Tell me.

124
04:44.252 --> 04:45.052
How will he

125
04:45.052 --> 04:46.052
view a case

126
04:46.091 --> 04:46.651
he already

127
04:46.651 --> 04:47.732
had doubts about?

128
04:49.172 --> 04:50.291
You want him

129
04:50.492 --> 04:51.451
to talk Di Liren down?

130
04:52.612 --> 04:54.971
Big shots hate petty nuisances.

131
04:55.091 --> 04:55.851
As the nuisances,

132
04:55.851 --> 04:56.492
our job is

133
04:56.492 --> 04:57.411
to keep hassling him,

134
04:57.572 --> 04:58.891
till he's done wasting time

135
04:58.891 --> 04:59.451
on this

136
04:59.492 --> 05:01.012
and convinces Di Liren to settle

137
05:01.252 --> 05:02.012
out of court.

138
05:12.284 --> 05:14.920
(Zi)

139
05:50.211 --> 05:51.132
You head up first.

140
06:02.732 --> 06:03.291
Zi,

141
06:04.492 --> 06:05.331
why did you meet

142
06:05.331 --> 06:06.132
with him alone?

143
06:09.012 --> 06:09.692
If this was

144
06:09.692 --> 06:10.732
about Liu Bai,

145
06:11.211 --> 06:12.531
Jiao Xu already found a way.

146
06:12.612 --> 06:14.172
Di Liren agreed to drop the lawsuit.

147
06:14.572 --> 06:15.612
Why didn't you

148
06:16.132 --> 06:16.651
tell me

149
06:16.692 --> 06:17.812
before meeting with him?

150
06:17.932 --> 06:19.211
Time was tight.

151
06:19.252 --> 06:20.411
He asked to meet,

152
06:20.971 --> 06:21.612
so I went.

153
06:22.372 --> 06:23.771
Liu Bai's account was banned,

154
06:23.812 --> 06:24.612
and I was fired.

155
06:25.012 --> 06:26.052
I provided the resources

156
06:26.091 --> 06:27.291
for his live streams.

157
06:27.812 --> 06:29.531
The police reached out to Rongmei Media,

158
06:29.692 --> 06:30.812
and the boss talked with me.

159
06:31.732 --> 06:32.732
So...

160
06:35.411 --> 06:36.372
Look, I've worked there

161
06:36.411 --> 06:37.291
for ages.

162
06:37.331 --> 06:38.291
I've been dying to quit.

163
06:38.372 --> 06:38.971
Don't worry.

164
06:39.211 --> 06:40.132
The company will

165
06:40.172 --> 06:41.451
assign someone to work with you.

166
06:43.451 --> 06:44.252
Where are you going?

167
06:45.732 --> 06:46.531
Stay here.

168
06:46.812 --> 06:47.986
I'll settle it with him.

169
06:48.252 --> 06:48.732
Meng,

170
06:48.891 --> 06:49.651
don't be reckless.

171
06:49.812 --> 06:51.091
Don't forget your main goal.

172
06:51.132 --> 06:52.012
He's dropped the suit.

173
06:52.052 --> 06:53.172
Just let it go.

174
06:53.411 --> 06:54.492
I can find another job

175
06:54.531 --> 06:55.732
and do something else.

176
06:56.172 --> 06:57.211
Just give me some time

177
06:57.492 --> 06:58.651
to reset, okay?

178
07:05.172 --> 07:05.692
Zi,

179
07:06.651 --> 07:07.612
I'll make it up

180
07:08.211 --> 07:09.052
to you

181
07:09.052 --> 07:09.812
ten times over.

182
07:12.052 --> 07:13.651
Mommy, Ms. Meng.

183
07:16.211 --> 07:16.851
Did I come

184
07:16.891 --> 07:18.132
at a bad time?

185
07:18.411 --> 07:18.971
Mommy,

186
07:19.372 --> 07:20.091
the teacher said

187
07:20.211 --> 07:22.132
I need playdough and watercolors

188
07:22.372 --> 07:23.451
for school tomorrow.

189
07:23.812 --> 07:24.891
Okay, I'll buy them for you

190
07:24.891 --> 07:25.812
first thing tomorrow.

191
07:26.132 --> 07:26.612
Okay.

192
07:27.692 --> 07:28.891
The stream room is banned,

193
07:29.091 --> 07:30.132
and the account is closed.

194
07:30.331 --> 07:31.411
I've been sending resumes,

195
07:31.732 --> 07:32.932
but nothing looks promising.

196
07:34.252 --> 07:35.211
I'm out of a job now.

197
07:36.172 --> 07:37.091
What am I going to do?

198
07:37.451 --> 07:38.372
Take it easy.

199
07:38.492 --> 07:39.091
Worst case,

200
07:39.132 --> 07:39.732
I'll feed you.

201
07:40.252 --> 07:40.891
Mommy,

202
07:40.971 --> 07:41.891
I'm hungry.

203
07:42.211 --> 07:43.331
Okay, I'm going to cook.

204
07:48.091 --> 07:48.812
You're still here?

205
07:51.052 --> 07:52.052
I mean,

206
07:52.091 --> 07:53.692
thanks for picking up Chestnut today.

207
07:54.052 --> 07:55.012
I'll treat you sometime.

208
07:57.211 --> 07:58.091
You can't support him.

209
07:58.091 --> 07:59.012
I ran the numbers.

210
07:59.331 --> 08:00.411
Your monthly salary

211
08:00.531 --> 08:01.252
barely covered

212
08:01.252 --> 08:02.252
you and Chestnut.

213
08:02.411 --> 08:03.252
Without a job,

214
08:03.572 --> 08:04.172
your money will

215
08:04.252 --> 08:05.172
last six months max.

216
08:05.732 --> 08:06.732
Add Liu Bai in,

217
08:07.132 --> 08:07.971
and it's only three.

218
08:08.891 --> 08:09.771
None of your business.

219
08:12.771 --> 08:14.132
Come on, go inside with me.

220
08:17.269 --> 08:17.971
It's not your job

221
08:17.971 --> 08:19.012
to take care of everyone.

222
08:19.692 --> 08:20.291
It's tiring.

223
08:20.451 --> 08:21.851
This is my family matter.

224
08:21.971 --> 08:23.012
None of your business.

225
08:24.572 --> 08:25.132
That way,

226
08:25.172 --> 08:26.451
Liu Bai will never grow up

227
08:26.572 --> 08:27.372
or be responsible.

228
08:27.572 --> 08:28.411
That's my choice.

229
08:31.572 --> 08:32.291
Anyway,

230
08:32.372 --> 08:33.732
thank you so much for today.

231
08:37.852 --> 08:38.411
Thanks.

232
09:02.651 --> 09:03.252
Harry?

233
09:05.931 --> 09:06.531
Harry.

234
09:08.212 --> 09:08.771
Harry!

235
09:10.811 --> 09:11.492
I'm sorry.

236
09:11.612 --> 09:12.372
I made a mistake.

237
09:20.060 --> 09:21.092
(Comprehensive Service Window)

238
09:21.092 --> 09:21.571
Excuse me.

239
09:21.811 --> 09:22.651
I'm here for a nurse

240
09:22.691 --> 09:23.651
named Lu Hui.

241
09:24.252 --> 09:25.212
Lu Hui?

242
09:25.252 --> 09:26.012
One moment.

243
09:28.092 --> 09:28.531
We don't

244
09:28.531 --> 09:29.811
have a nurse named Lu Hui here.

245
09:30.051 --> 09:30.771
What?

246
09:35.291 --> 09:35.852
Weng Yue.

247
09:35.995 --> 09:37.972
(Psychiatry)

248
09:37.972 --> 09:39.092
What are you doing here?

249
09:39.291 --> 09:40.291
I need a favor.

250
09:42.012 --> 09:42.891
What do you want?

251
09:51.811 --> 09:53.051
Jinghua's inventory logs.

252
09:54.411 --> 09:55.571
That's a trade secret.

253
09:55.891 --> 09:56.852
Coming to me means

254
09:56.891 --> 09:57.852
you also can't get it

255
09:57.891 --> 09:58.531
inside Jiali.

256
09:59.212 --> 09:59.531
Right.

257
10:00.012 --> 10:01.771
I heard you've been suspended.

258
10:03.092 --> 10:04.931
You're an outsider now.

259
10:05.332 --> 10:06.411
No way I'd give it to you.

260
10:06.771 --> 10:07.372
Weng Yue,

261
10:08.092 --> 10:09.771
Jiali means just as much to me

262
10:10.012 --> 10:11.531
as Yaoyan means to you.

263
10:11.811 --> 10:12.571
I can never

264
10:12.571 --> 10:13.691
let defective products

265
10:13.811 --> 10:14.852
hit the market,

266
10:15.332 --> 10:16.291
or it would

267
10:16.291 --> 10:17.291
ruin Jiali's reputation.

268
10:18.732 --> 10:20.132
I'm sure you'd do the same

269
10:20.531 --> 10:21.492
if you were in my shoes.

270
10:21.972 --> 10:22.691
True.

271
10:24.651 --> 10:25.931
Still, I can't agree.

272
10:26.972 --> 10:27.931
If this log

273
10:27.931 --> 10:29.411
leaks from me,

274
10:29.531 --> 10:30.651
I'll be held accountable.

275
10:32.372 --> 10:33.411
We're not close enough

276
10:33.411 --> 10:34.171
for me

277
10:34.171 --> 10:35.771
to take that kind of risk for you.

278
10:41.972 --> 10:43.651
I heard you're sick.

279
10:46.092 --> 10:47.571
Weng Yue

280
10:47.931 --> 10:49.092
never wastes words.

281
10:49.531 --> 10:51.291
She wouldn't ask if I was sick

282
10:51.372 --> 10:52.571
for no reason.

283
10:52.811 --> 10:54.132
Someone must be up to something.

284
10:54.411 --> 10:55.051
Did she hint

285
10:55.092 --> 10:56.012
on purpose?

286
10:57.012 --> 10:57.651
I think so.

287
10:58.132 --> 10:59.332
Besides, I could tell

288
10:59.492 --> 11:00.571
she and Han Guang

289
11:00.612 --> 11:01.411
don't get along.

290
11:02.571 --> 11:03.852
She's actually an ally

291
11:04.012 --> 11:04.571
we could

292
11:04.571 --> 11:05.612
bring to our side.

293
11:05.891 --> 11:06.531
The thing is,

294
11:06.531 --> 11:07.332
she doesn't trust me

295
11:07.651 --> 11:08.732
enough to help me openly.

296
11:11.571 --> 11:11.852
Right.

297
11:12.452 --> 11:13.651
I think you should

298
11:13.691 --> 11:14.531
dig more

299
11:14.571 --> 11:15.372
into the Wengs,

300
11:15.571 --> 11:16.452
especially

301
11:16.492 --> 11:17.452
her, Han Guang,

302
11:17.732 --> 11:18.691
and Weng Xin.

303
11:21.171 --> 11:21.612
Got it.

304
11:26.051 --> 11:27.492
I caught one!

305
11:29.012 --> 11:30.012
Then it's yours.

306
11:30.051 --> 11:30.651
Just take it.

307
11:30.931 --> 11:31.972
So generous.

308
11:32.291 --> 11:32.771
I thought

309
11:32.811 --> 11:34.012
you'd charge me for it.

310
11:34.931 --> 11:35.811
If you want to pay,

311
11:35.931 --> 11:36.852
I won't say no.

312
11:38.092 --> 11:39.012
In your dreams.

313
11:39.891 --> 11:40.531
Your plushies

314
11:40.571 --> 11:41.651
are pretty good quality.

315
11:41.771 --> 11:42.732
Where'd you get them?

316
11:42.732 --> 11:43.612
Not this one.

317
11:44.691 --> 11:45.651
Pick another one.

318
11:45.732 --> 11:46.332
Anything else.

319
11:46.492 --> 11:47.092
Why?

320
11:49.132 --> 11:50.332
Don't tell me

321
11:50.771 --> 11:52.372
your ex gave you this.

322
11:53.492 --> 11:54.571
This one is already

323
11:55.092 --> 11:55.811
discontinued.

324
11:56.531 --> 11:57.092
Get it?

325
11:58.132 --> 11:59.092
Cheapskate.

326
11:59.372 --> 11:59.911
Take it back.

327
12:08.212 --> 12:09.829
Mr. Tian's coming for dinner tonight.

328
12:10.531 --> 12:11.452
I compiled all the info

329
12:11.452 --> 12:12.291
and sent it over.

330
12:12.291 --> 12:12.972
I need to go back

331
12:12.972 --> 12:13.651
and get ready.

332
12:14.852 --> 12:16.051
Whether I can make a comeback

333
12:16.051 --> 12:17.252
and get the signing authority

334
12:17.252 --> 12:18.411
rides on Jinghua.

335
12:18.891 --> 12:19.291
Bye.

336
12:27.771 --> 12:28.531
Weng Xin.

337
12:34.600 --> 12:37.160
(Weng Xin)

338
12:37.160 --> 12:38.824
(No answer)

339
12:38.824 --> 12:39.912
(Where are you? Call back ASAP.)

340
12:39.912 --> 12:41.192
(No answer)

341
12:44.651 --> 12:45.212
Meng.

342
12:46.092 --> 12:46.891
This is...

343
12:47.332 --> 12:47.811
Mr. Tian,

344
12:48.252 --> 12:49.691
this is a doctor friend of mine.

345
12:50.051 --> 12:50.811
He's interested

346
12:50.891 --> 12:51.651
in Jiali,

347
12:52.051 --> 12:52.571
so today,

348
12:52.612 --> 12:53.531
I invited him

349
12:53.571 --> 12:54.372
to meet you

350
12:54.612 --> 12:55.132
and see

351
12:55.171 --> 12:56.092
if we can collaborate.

352
12:57.931 --> 12:58.682
Nice to meet you.

353
12:58.732 --> 12:59.171
Me too.

354
12:59.252 --> 12:59.771
Mr. Tian,

355
13:00.372 --> 13:01.571
I organized the info

356
13:01.612 --> 13:02.411
and sent it to you.

357
13:03.171 --> 13:03.852
Did you see?

358
13:06.612 --> 13:07.212
Honey,

359
13:07.531 --> 13:08.571
why did you serve mutton?

360
13:09.051 --> 13:10.571
Mr. Tian doesn't eat mutton, remember?

361
13:11.852 --> 13:12.811
Mutton?

362
13:13.852 --> 13:14.252
Well...

363
13:14.691 --> 13:15.171
Ms. Hui,

364
13:15.492 --> 13:16.332
what's going on here?

365
13:17.171 --> 13:18.411
You bought the meat.

366
13:19.411 --> 13:20.332
Impossible.

367
13:20.691 --> 13:21.651
Are you mistaken?

368
13:24.012 --> 13:24.612
Ms. Hui,

369
13:24.972 --> 13:25.891
take it away right now.

370
13:26.931 --> 13:27.372
Sure.

371
13:30.411 --> 13:31.452
I'm so sorry, Mr. Tian.

372
13:33.332 --> 13:34.452
It's fine, Meng.

373
13:35.051 --> 13:35.972
Don't worry about it.

374
13:36.212 --> 13:37.132
Let's just eat.

375
13:37.332 --> 13:38.691
I'm really sorry, Mr. Tian.

376
13:39.092 --> 13:40.332
I guess I wasn't clear.

377
13:40.492 --> 13:41.531
Please try the others.

378
13:41.691 --> 13:42.332
Try that one.

379
13:47.852 --> 13:48.612
Mrs. Tian,

380
13:49.092 --> 13:50.691
I got you a present.

381
13:51.372 --> 13:52.612
When I was out shopping,

382
13:52.852 --> 13:53.891
it caught my eye.

383
13:54.212 --> 13:54.931
Check out

384
13:55.372 --> 13:56.571
if you like this necklace.

385
13:56.771 --> 13:57.452
Thank you.

386
14:04.732 --> 14:05.332
Honey,

387
14:06.132 --> 14:07.291
those are earrings.

388
14:07.891 --> 14:09.012
Why did you say necklace?

389
14:09.571 --> 14:10.291
Impossible.

390
14:10.291 --> 14:11.531
I know her ears aren't pierced.

391
14:11.531 --> 14:12.651
It's definitely a necklace.

392
14:13.291 --> 14:13.771
Take a look.

393
14:17.691 --> 14:19.012
It's okay. They're lovely.

394
14:19.051 --> 14:20.852
I can have them converted into ear clips.

395
14:21.051 --> 14:22.531
I clearly bought a necklace.

396
14:22.771 --> 14:23.212
I actually

397
14:23.291 --> 14:24.411
spent so long picking it out

398
14:24.452 --> 14:25.651
and watched the clerk

399
14:25.691 --> 14:26.411
pack it.

400
14:38.092 --> 14:38.612
Ms. Yu,

401
14:39.092 --> 14:40.252
can you recall the details

402
14:40.372 --> 14:41.651
when you bought the necklace?

403
14:43.012 --> 14:43.732
Of course.

404
14:44.252 --> 14:45.372
I bought it last Friday.

405
14:46.212 --> 14:47.252
I still have the receipt.

406
14:50.652 --> 14:52.328
(Item: Dainty Stud Earrings)

407
14:55.411 --> 14:56.051
Let me see.

408
14:59.740 --> 15:00.680
(Item: Dainty Stud Earrings)

409
15:01.891 --> 15:02.531
Honey,

410
15:02.852 --> 15:04.051
it says earrings right here.

411
15:04.531 --> 15:05.891
Why did you say necklace?

412
15:06.492 --> 15:08.132
If this is accurate,

413
15:08.452 --> 15:08.972
you might

414
15:09.012 --> 15:10.411
have a mental health issue.

415
15:11.732 --> 15:13.452
I'd suggest having an evaluation done

416
15:13.492 --> 15:14.212
at a real clinic.

417
15:14.891 --> 15:16.332
It's best not to self-diagnose.

418
15:21.612 --> 15:22.811
(Our bodies)

419
15:23.171 --> 15:24.171
(need rest.)

420
15:24.452 --> 15:25.891
(You should keep her company)

421
15:26.012 --> 15:27.012
(in the mountains.)

422
15:27.212 --> 15:28.012
(Surrounded)

423
15:28.171 --> 15:29.852
(by beautiful scenery,)

424
15:29.931 --> 15:31.452
she can reset her mood

425
15:31.492 --> 15:32.252
and body.

426
15:32.651 --> 15:34.571
She might not even need medication anymore.

427
15:35.891 --> 15:36.492
Honey,

428
15:37.132 --> 15:38.012
don't overthink this.

429
15:38.972 --> 15:39.732
Let's eat,

430
15:39.891 --> 15:40.332
okay?

431
15:42.332 --> 15:42.891
Fine.

432
15:43.811 --> 15:45.012
Now I get it.

433
15:45.492 --> 15:46.771
But let me make one thing clear:

434
15:47.411 --> 15:48.171
I am not sick.

435
15:49.691 --> 15:50.332
Excuse me,

436
15:50.492 --> 15:51.612
I have something else to do.

437
15:52.092 --> 15:52.852
I have to go now.

438
15:53.092 --> 15:53.852
Mr. and Mrs. Tian,

439
15:53.931 --> 15:54.619
enjoy your meal.

440
16:01.972 --> 16:02.811
You're finally here.

441
16:03.492 --> 16:04.651
What's wrong? Didn't go well?

442
16:05.132 --> 16:05.651
No.

443
16:06.651 --> 16:08.092
Di Liren pulled a whole stunt

444
16:08.372 --> 16:09.092
before Mr. Tian

445
16:09.132 --> 16:09.972
to slander me.

446
16:11.012 --> 16:12.171
Now even Mr. Tian thinks

447
16:12.212 --> 16:13.132
I'm mentally unstable.

448
16:13.891 --> 16:15.012
I need to get tested

449
16:15.051 --> 16:15.732
right away

450
16:15.972 --> 16:17.372
to prove I'm sane.

451
16:17.972 --> 16:18.852
Di Liren

452
16:18.891 --> 16:20.411
is completely out of line now.

453
16:21.612 --> 16:22.931
You're totally fine mentally.

454
16:23.291 --> 16:23.931
He just wants

455
16:23.931 --> 16:24.531
to turn you

456
16:24.531 --> 16:25.531
into a madwoman.

457
16:25.651 --> 16:26.732
You need the test,

458
16:26.811 --> 16:27.891
but at the right time,

459
16:27.891 --> 16:28.691
in the right way,

460
16:28.732 --> 16:29.372
to force him

461
16:29.411 --> 16:30.452
to admit you're fine,

462
16:30.531 --> 16:31.531
or it will backfire.

463
16:34.012 --> 16:34.931
I take you to Liu Zi's?

464
16:35.372 --> 16:36.252
I...

465
16:37.411 --> 16:38.732
She said

466
16:38.852 --> 16:40.012
she needs some quiet time.

467
16:42.492 --> 16:43.171
Well then,

468
16:43.852 --> 16:45.012
I have a new secret place.

469
16:45.132 --> 16:45.651
Coming?

470
16:47.132 --> 16:47.732
Come on in.

471
16:48.931 --> 16:49.492
Have a seat.

472
16:54.012 --> 16:55.531
This is the secret place you meant?

473
16:57.332 --> 16:58.531
Special treatment today,

474
16:58.732 --> 16:59.811
no admission fee.

475
17:01.092 --> 17:02.651
You're the one who invited me,

476
17:02.732 --> 17:03.691
and you charge me?

477
17:08.571 --> 17:09.252
Mr. Jiao,

478
17:10.331 --> 17:11.452
you can play the suona?

479
17:12.571 --> 17:13.972
I learned it on my own.

480
17:14.212 --> 17:15.051
Really?

481
17:16.012 --> 17:17.331
A client of yours

482
17:17.371 --> 17:18.206
left this here, no?

483
17:21.892 --> 17:22.811
Listen closely.

484
17:37.091 --> 17:38.331
Stop!

485
17:38.811 --> 17:39.331
Stop!

486
17:40.412 --> 17:41.771
What are you even playing?

487
17:42.131 --> 17:43.012
You got it?

488
17:43.892 --> 17:45.012
Nobody could.

489
17:46.692 --> 17:48.091
Stop playing, Mr. Jiao.

490
17:48.611 --> 17:49.692
Otherwise, you will

491
17:49.692 --> 17:50.412
get a legal note.

492
17:55.811 --> 17:56.652
Did you learn this

493
17:56.932 --> 17:58.212
for your lawsuits?

494
17:58.771 --> 17:59.972
I grew up around it.

495
18:00.371 --> 18:01.172
My parents were

496
18:01.291 --> 18:02.571
in the funeral business.

497
18:03.252 --> 18:03.949
Funeral business?

498
18:05.611 --> 18:06.412
So I've always felt

499
18:06.412 --> 18:07.291
life is short.

500
18:07.531 --> 18:08.771
Buy what you love,

501
18:08.811 --> 18:10.412
do what you want to do,

502
18:10.851 --> 18:11.652
and don't hesitate,

503
18:12.571 --> 18:14.252
or you might never get another chance.

504
18:16.131 --> 18:16.571
Thanks.

505
18:17.851 --> 18:19.331
Aren't you being a bit pessimistic?

506
18:21.012 --> 18:22.692
Not pessimistic, realistic.

507
18:23.452 --> 18:24.131
Ten years ago,

508
18:24.131 --> 18:25.252
I already wrote my will.

509
18:25.412 --> 18:26.851
I update the notarization yearly.

510
18:27.571 --> 18:28.571
So many tragedies strike

511
18:28.611 --> 18:29.972
before the next day.

512
18:30.291 --> 18:30.932
You never know

513
18:30.972 --> 18:31.771
what's coming next.

514
18:33.252 --> 18:33.811
True.

515
18:34.972 --> 18:35.972
A few months ago,

516
18:36.452 --> 18:38.042
I never would've imagined being here.

517
18:40.371 --> 18:41.412
Who knows how many rumors

518
18:41.452 --> 18:42.972
Di Liren spread out there

519
18:43.051 --> 18:44.492
about me being crazy.

520
18:45.452 --> 18:46.492
He plotted all this

521
18:46.492 --> 18:47.412
so meticulously,

522
18:48.091 --> 18:49.732
not just to seize power,

523
18:50.611 --> 18:52.051
but to destroy my credibility.

524
18:52.531 --> 18:53.412
That way, if I

525
18:53.412 --> 18:54.652
expose his thing with Lu Hui,

526
18:54.892 --> 18:56.051
people will think I'm insane.

527
18:57.892 --> 18:58.932
That only proves

528
18:58.972 --> 19:00.172
our strategy is working.

529
19:00.732 --> 19:01.492
We cornered him

530
19:01.531 --> 19:03.051
into such cheap tricks.

531
19:03.331 --> 19:03.892
He used to

532
19:03.932 --> 19:04.892
nail every situation.

533
19:05.371 --> 19:06.452
By that logic,

534
19:07.212 --> 19:08.531
this counts as a victory for us?

535
19:20.732 --> 19:21.571
Again?

536
19:22.771 --> 19:24.072
Why wouldn't it count?

537
19:28.331 --> 19:29.492
Don't you fear your neighbors

538
19:29.851 --> 19:31.131
will complain about the noise?

539
19:32.652 --> 19:34.371
I'm only worried you'll lose heart.

540
19:34.412 --> 19:35.331
What if you quit

541
19:35.492 --> 19:36.652
and skip out on my payment?

542
19:37.692 --> 19:39.571
I won't lose heart.

543
19:40.571 --> 19:41.571
I'm just thinking

544
19:42.012 --> 19:43.291
about what we should do next.

545
20:12.411 --> 20:13.832
(Di Liren, Han Guang)

546
20:13.832 --> 20:15.892
(Lin Qiang, Warehouse)

547
20:15.892 --> 20:16.771
I don't think Di Liren

548
20:16.811 --> 20:17.771
has enough power

549
20:17.811 --> 20:19.331
to rig an independent testing agency.

550
20:19.732 --> 20:20.652
The only possibility is

551
20:20.811 --> 20:21.851
that the warehouse samples

552
20:21.851 --> 20:22.571
were swapped.

553
20:23.012 --> 20:24.051
And tampering always

554
20:24.291 --> 20:25.412
leaves a trail.

555
20:27.051 --> 20:28.611
You are really something, Mr. Jiao.

556
20:30.091 --> 20:31.571
If we cross-check receipts

557
20:31.611 --> 20:33.091
against batch numbers,

558
20:33.371 --> 20:34.571
wouldn't that prove...

559
20:36.172 --> 20:36.851
Wait,

560
20:37.652 --> 20:38.331
I'm not even

561
20:38.331 --> 20:39.452
at the company anymore.

562
20:46.412 --> 20:47.571
You did great today.

563
20:49.371 --> 20:50.212
Mr. Tian bought it.

564
20:51.252 --> 20:52.091
We used to fear

565
20:52.131 --> 20:53.452
she'd hunt us down even abroad

566
20:53.732 --> 20:55.212
and never let us go

567
20:56.371 --> 20:58.131
because she had money, friends,

568
20:58.252 --> 20:59.131
and resources.

569
21:00.051 --> 21:01.452
But now, if everyone thinks

570
21:01.492 --> 21:02.331
she's sick

571
21:02.692 --> 21:04.051
and needs to be institutionalized,

572
21:04.492 --> 21:05.571
what do we have to fear?

573
21:06.771 --> 21:07.732
She can't do anything

574
21:07.771 --> 21:08.371
to Haoyu then.

575
21:08.811 --> 21:09.371
Of course.

576
21:12.892 --> 21:13.771
What do you plan to do

577
21:14.172 --> 21:14.811
with this?

578
21:18.212 --> 21:18.932
Yu Meng

579
21:19.732 --> 21:20.371
was supposed

580
21:20.371 --> 21:21.412
to give this to Mrs. Tian.

581
21:22.091 --> 21:23.452
You had me swap it for earrings.

582
21:25.131 --> 21:26.172
Keep it if you like it.

583
21:26.611 --> 21:27.771
I don't want her stuff.

584
21:28.371 --> 21:29.212
Then toss it.

585
21:29.932 --> 21:30.692
You will

586
21:31.091 --> 21:32.331
have as many as you want soon.

587
21:39.196 --> 21:40.072
(Liu Bai's Resume)

588
21:40.072 --> 21:41.160
(Majored in Psychology)

589
21:41.160 --> 21:42.428
(Used to be a content creator)

590
21:45.652 --> 21:46.291
Mommy,

591
21:46.571 --> 21:47.932
don't forget my playdough

592
21:47.972 --> 21:49.212
and watercolors.

593
21:50.571 --> 21:51.531
I nearly forgot.

594
21:52.172 --> 21:53.131
Breakfast is ready.

595
21:53.212 --> 21:54.012
Go ahead and eat.

596
21:54.172 --> 21:54.732
Okay.

597
21:58.652 --> 21:59.051
Sit.

598
22:26.212 --> 22:27.732
Liu Bai, why did you buy...

599
22:27.932 --> 22:28.932
(I didn't know)

600
22:28.972 --> 22:30.172
(what kind of watercolors,)

601
22:30.172 --> 22:30.851
(so I bought)

602
22:30.851 --> 22:31.147
Zi.

603
22:31.147 --> 22:31.692
(all of them.)

604
22:31.692 --> 22:32.252
What is it?

605
22:34.091 --> 22:34.932
Are you going out?

606
22:35.091 --> 22:35.652
An interview.

607
22:36.091 --> 22:36.732
Looks good?

608
22:37.452 --> 22:38.091
Look,

609
22:38.212 --> 22:38.771
Kang Long

610
22:38.851 --> 22:40.412
referred me to two companies.

611
22:41.172 --> 22:41.811
Running late.

612
22:41.892 --> 22:42.452
I have to go.

613
22:43.091 --> 22:44.131
Which companies?

614
22:44.172 --> 22:45.652
I haven't polished your resume yet.

615
22:45.851 --> 22:46.771
E-commerce companies.

616
22:46.811 --> 22:47.811
I'm really into them.

617
22:48.012 --> 22:48.452
He already

618
22:48.571 --> 22:49.531
polished my resume.

619
22:50.412 --> 22:51.172
Bye, Chestnut!

620
22:51.732 --> 22:52.212
Bye, Zi!

621
22:52.652 --> 22:53.409
Wish me luck!

622
23:00.172 --> 23:02.611
Uncle's so energetic today.

623
23:02.932 --> 23:03.732
Indeed.

624
23:04.212 --> 23:04.692
I thought

625
23:04.692 --> 23:06.012
he'd stay home for three months.

626
23:06.012 --> 23:07.091
But I wonder,

627
23:07.371 --> 23:08.692
if he flunks the interview,

628
23:08.811 --> 23:09.900
will he be upset again?

629
23:19.051 --> 23:19.452
Hello.

630
23:19.531 --> 23:20.811
Mr. Kang hired me

631
23:20.811 --> 23:22.291
to clean for three hours.

632
23:22.531 --> 23:23.531
Is it okay to start now?

633
23:24.012 --> 23:24.932
I can't believe this.

634
23:25.771 --> 23:26.932
Can't I clean up myself?

635
23:27.771 --> 23:29.452
Is our place really that messy?

636
23:31.091 --> 23:31.811
No, thanks.

637
23:34.212 --> 23:34.771
Wait.

638
23:35.692 --> 23:36.629
Since you're here...

639
23:38.692 --> 23:39.291
Meng,

640
23:40.652 --> 23:41.811
someone named Weng Yue

641
23:41.851 --> 23:43.091
brought something and asked me

642
23:43.252 --> 23:44.252
to give it to you.

643
23:45.331 --> 23:45.892
Weng Yue?

644
23:53.787 --> 23:55.368
(Get Well Soon)

645
24:06.252 --> 24:06.771
Hello?

646
24:07.252 --> 24:08.652
I brought something for your dad.

647
24:08.932 --> 24:10.371
In a rush, I left a flash drive

648
24:10.371 --> 24:11.771
containing our company's files

649
24:11.811 --> 24:12.611
in the hospital.

650
24:12.811 --> 24:13.652
Did you see it?

651
24:14.908 --> 24:16.040
(Get Well Soon)

652
24:21.492 --> 24:22.131
No.

653
24:23.732 --> 24:24.412
That's a relief.

654
24:24.892 --> 24:25.892
I was scared to death.

655
24:25.932 --> 24:27.371
I thought

656
24:27.412 --> 24:28.291
I lost our company's

657
24:28.291 --> 24:29.131
trade secrets.

658
24:30.932 --> 24:32.212
A cautious person like you

659
24:32.371 --> 24:33.051
couldn't do that.

660
24:36.331 --> 24:37.811
Weng Yue knows how to avoid risk.

661
24:37.892 --> 24:39.252
With this call log,

662
24:39.531 --> 24:40.331
she won't be accused

663
24:40.331 --> 24:41.452
of leaking secret files.

664
24:42.811 --> 24:44.051
Still, your intake logs

665
24:44.091 --> 24:45.172
have over 6,000 entries.

666
24:45.452 --> 24:46.452
Can you finish all that?

667
24:47.531 --> 24:48.131
Mr. Jiao,

668
24:48.212 --> 24:49.611
if I couldn't even handle this,

669
24:49.892 --> 24:51.517
she wouldn't have bothered helping me.

670
24:57.131 --> 24:57.811
Mr. Tian.

671
24:57.972 --> 24:58.851
Good to see you!

672
24:58.851 --> 24:59.611
Me too, Mr. Han.

673
24:59.611 --> 25:00.652
- Hello. - Hello.

674
25:00.652 --> 25:01.131
This way.

675
25:02.252 --> 25:02.811
Han,

676
25:03.452 --> 25:04.331
it wasn't easy for me

677
25:04.412 --> 25:05.795
to get you time with Mr. Tian.

678
25:05.972 --> 25:07.091
Make the most of it.

679
25:07.131 --> 25:08.012
Of course.

680
25:08.331 --> 25:09.212
We just

681
25:09.252 --> 25:10.051
developed new stuff

682
25:10.091 --> 25:11.732
and we'd love Mr. Tian's guidance.

683
25:14.212 --> 25:15.571
Are you done yet?

684
25:15.611 --> 25:16.531
Until you give me

685
25:16.571 --> 25:17.811
a reasonable explanation,

686
25:18.051 --> 25:18.932
this isn't over!

687
25:20.771 --> 25:21.371
Honey,

688
25:21.932 --> 25:22.652
why are you here?

689
25:23.692 --> 25:24.291
Honey,

690
25:24.892 --> 25:26.012
I suspect their company

691
25:26.131 --> 25:27.652
swapped the test samples for Jinghua.

692
25:27.892 --> 25:29.492
The test report can't be trusted at all.

693
25:29.892 --> 25:30.932
That's slander!

694
25:30.972 --> 25:31.851
Show us the proof!

695
25:31.932 --> 25:32.732
I checked

696
25:32.771 --> 25:34.331
all the inventory logs for Jinghua.

697
25:34.452 --> 25:36.012
The batch numbers of the test samples

698
25:36.051 --> 25:36.851
and the stock logs

699
25:36.892 --> 25:37.652
don't match at all.

700
25:37.851 --> 25:38.571
This is my proof!

701
25:38.892 --> 25:40.012
Where did you get them?

702
25:40.012 --> 25:40.892
Must be a mistake.

703
25:41.291 --> 25:42.371
Mr. Di, stay out of this.

704
25:42.732 --> 25:44.091
I want an explanation, too.

705
25:44.452 --> 25:45.531
She has been targeting us

706
25:45.571 --> 25:46.571
for a long time.

707
25:46.732 --> 25:47.571
I can't figure out

708
25:47.611 --> 25:48.531
what she's up to.

709
25:48.851 --> 25:49.972
She beefs with the company,

710
25:50.012 --> 25:51.291
or with me?

711
25:51.811 --> 25:52.972
Since you have doubts,

712
25:53.172 --> 25:53.811
have Mr. Lin

713
25:53.811 --> 25:54.771
come out and explain.

714
25:55.412 --> 25:56.371
Who is this?

715
25:58.252 --> 25:58.732
Weng Yue,

716
25:58.732 --> 25:59.571
my wife's sister.

717
26:00.452 --> 26:01.932
No need to make a fuss over this.

718
26:01.972 --> 26:02.771
I think it might be

719
26:03.012 --> 26:03.972
just a clerical error.

720
26:05.611 --> 26:07.291
Thousands of entries are correct,

721
26:07.571 --> 26:09.091
yet only the test samples are wrong?

722
26:09.692 --> 26:11.012
Quite a coincidence, isn't it?

723
26:11.571 --> 26:13.091
When it comes to brand image,

724
26:13.291 --> 26:14.652
everything is a big deal.

725
26:14.771 --> 26:16.091
Since Miss Yu has concerns,

726
26:16.212 --> 26:17.252
I can personally

727
26:17.291 --> 26:19.012
send another batch of Jinghua for testing.

728
26:19.692 --> 26:20.732
That's not necessary.

729
26:21.131 --> 26:22.412
It's already been tested twice.

730
26:24.452 --> 26:25.851
Once more won't hurt.

731
26:29.692 --> 26:30.732
If it can finally

732
26:31.452 --> 26:32.252
put Meng's mind

733
26:32.331 --> 26:33.732
at ease,

734
26:34.291 --> 26:35.051
it's worth it.

735
26:36.331 --> 26:36.811
Well,

736
26:37.371 --> 26:38.012
let Meng

737
26:38.972 --> 26:40.012
handle it in person.

738
26:41.771 --> 26:42.652
Don't worry, Mr. Tian.

739
26:43.412 --> 26:44.252
I'll do it myself.

740
26:46.291 --> 26:46.811
Mr. Di,

741
26:46.892 --> 26:48.371
if Miss Yu send samples for testing,

742
26:48.412 --> 26:49.412
she'll find out soon.

743
26:49.531 --> 26:50.571
Once the results are out,

744
26:50.611 --> 26:52.252
I'll be the first one locked up!

745
26:52.492 --> 26:53.371
Everything I did

746
26:53.452 --> 26:54.732
was on Mr. Han's orders!

747
26:54.771 --> 26:56.252
Otherwise, I'd never have the guts.

748
26:56.692 --> 26:57.331
He told me

749
26:57.371 --> 26:58.771
to ignore the active ingredients,

750
26:58.933 --> 26:59.692
saying he'd already

751
26:59.692 --> 27:00.932
hooked up the QC team,

752
27:01.172 --> 27:02.331
and that easy money's ours.

753
27:02.531 --> 27:03.652
That's an internal matter.

754
27:03.892 --> 27:04.932
Deal with it yourselves.

755
27:05.012 --> 27:05.932
I can't help you.

756
27:06.212 --> 27:06.571
Look,

757
27:06.652 --> 27:07.091
Mr. Di,

758
27:07.692 --> 27:08.492
could you

759
27:08.892 --> 27:09.851
hit Mr. Han up for me?

760
27:09.892 --> 27:11.531
H-He keeps avoiding me.

761
27:11.892 --> 27:12.331
Look...

762
27:12.452 --> 27:13.371
I'm sorry,

763
27:13.811 --> 27:14.811
but I'm off to a meeting.

764
27:15.531 --> 27:16.771
W-Wait, Mr. Di...

765
27:17.811 --> 27:18.571
Mr. Di, please!

766
27:21.611 --> 27:23.571
Miss Yu, please help me out.

767
27:23.732 --> 27:24.811
Please, help me!

768
27:25.091 --> 27:25.892
Mr. Lin,

769
27:26.371 --> 27:27.331
only you

770
27:27.571 --> 27:28.531
can save yourself.

771
27:28.771 --> 27:29.571
What do you mean?

772
27:29.611 --> 27:31.212
I-I don't understand.

773
27:31.771 --> 27:33.331
How did you

774
27:33.811 --> 27:35.091
forge the Jinghua samples?

775
27:35.212 --> 27:36.652
Who put you up to it?

776
27:37.172 --> 27:38.611
Lay it all out in detail

777
27:38.652 --> 27:39.291
at the meeting.

778
27:39.692 --> 27:40.851
If you tell the truth,

779
27:41.212 --> 27:42.252
from the company's side,

780
27:42.531 --> 27:43.252
I can guarantee

781
27:43.492 --> 27:44.571
they will go easy on you,

782
27:45.492 --> 27:46.571
or the production files

783
27:46.611 --> 27:47.652
with your signature

784
27:48.291 --> 27:49.771
will be solid proof to lock you up.

785
28:08.291 --> 28:09.571
(I miss you, Zi.)

786
28:10.012 --> 28:10.732
(Can we talk?)

787
28:11.172 --> 28:12.892
(See you at the usual place tonight.)

788
28:21.652 --> 28:22.571
Zi,

789
28:22.611 --> 28:24.172
I missed you so much!

790
28:24.452 --> 28:26.091
You didn't contact me for days.

791
28:26.611 --> 28:27.172
I thought

792
28:27.172 --> 28:28.452
you'd never talk to me again.

793
28:28.492 --> 28:29.452
Nonsense, silly.

794
28:29.732 --> 28:30.851
It wasn't your fault.

795
28:35.131 --> 28:36.771
I've thought it through these days.

796
28:37.291 --> 28:38.371
My brother got arrested,

797
28:38.412 --> 28:39.331
and I lost my job.

798
28:39.492 --> 28:41.091
Di Liren set up the whole trap.

799
28:41.371 --> 28:42.212
He's a bad person

800
28:42.811 --> 28:43.972
and deserves to be punished.

801
28:44.412 --> 28:45.732
Don't say that.

802
28:46.172 --> 28:47.492
You're being so understanding,

803
28:47.571 --> 28:48.892
which only makes me feel worse.

804
28:49.012 --> 28:49.972
I'd rather you hit me

805
28:50.012 --> 28:50.732
or yell at me.

806
28:50.851 --> 28:51.972
That'll make me feel better.

807
28:53.492 --> 28:54.932
You're really going to hit me?

808
28:55.331 --> 28:56.571
Come on.

809
28:56.611 --> 28:58.531
Not a single text all week?

810
28:58.611 --> 28:59.212
You deserve it.

811
28:59.412 --> 29:00.452
I do!

812
29:01.131 --> 29:02.091
I was just worried

813
29:02.331 --> 29:03.652
you'd find me annoying.

814
29:03.771 --> 29:05.212
So I didn't dare reach out to you.

815
29:06.732 --> 29:07.771
We used to talk

816
29:07.811 --> 29:08.732
every single day.

817
29:08.932 --> 29:10.051
When it suddenly went quiet,

818
29:10.692 --> 29:11.452
I just felt empty

819
29:11.492 --> 29:12.212
inside.

820
29:13.611 --> 29:14.252
Look,

821
29:14.811 --> 29:16.091
I wrote what I wanted to say

822
29:16.412 --> 29:17.412
to you in this notebook.

823
29:17.932 --> 29:18.492
Take a look.

824
29:19.212 --> 29:20.172
(Eat well no matter what) You're still just like when you were

825
29:20.172 --> 29:20.851
back in school.

826
29:21.371 --> 29:22.972
You always write things down

827
29:23.012 --> 29:23.652
in small pads.

828
29:24.932 --> 29:26.212
I have something for you too.

829
29:27.172 --> 29:27.932
Ice cream!

830
29:28.811 --> 29:30.492
I've been craving this for days!

831
29:33.452 --> 29:34.932
You always know me best,

832
29:35.012 --> 29:35.851
my sweet Zi.

833
29:38.252 --> 29:39.172
What flavor is yours?

834
29:39.412 --> 29:40.051
Strawberry.

835
29:40.331 --> 29:40.811
Let me try.

836
29:40.892 --> 29:41.252
Go ahead.

837
29:46.811 --> 29:47.851
It's so good!

838
29:47.972 --> 29:48.732
Delicious!

839
29:51.291 --> 29:52.012
Do you remember

840
29:52.012 --> 29:53.252
back when we were in school?

841
29:54.252 --> 29:54.771
After school,

842
29:54.771 --> 29:55.811
we'd come straight here.

843
29:56.492 --> 29:57.212
Every single day,

844
29:57.212 --> 29:58.051
we'd buy an ice cream

845
29:58.172 --> 29:59.692
and hang out here eating it.

846
30:00.131 --> 30:01.131
We were so happy.

847
30:01.412 --> 30:02.652
Of course, I remember.

848
30:03.851 --> 30:04.492
My birthday

849
30:04.492 --> 30:05.811
fell during summer break.

850
30:06.291 --> 30:08.012
As a kid, I always felt ripped off.

851
30:08.492 --> 30:09.892
I never got a birthday gift back

852
30:09.932 --> 30:11.212
in return.

853
30:12.811 --> 30:13.851
Only you remembered.

854
30:13.892 --> 30:15.652
You'd always call me right on time

855
30:15.692 --> 30:16.692
to say happy birthday.

856
30:17.611 --> 30:18.531
We used to sit here,

857
30:18.571 --> 30:19.571
eating ice cream

858
30:19.611 --> 30:20.611
and exchanging gifts.

859
30:21.252 --> 30:22.291
You've actually always

860
30:22.331 --> 30:23.652
been such a thoughtful person,

861
30:24.412 --> 30:25.492
even if you seem carefree

862
30:25.492 --> 30:26.252
on the surface.

863
30:26.972 --> 30:27.531
Zi,

864
30:28.851 --> 30:30.412
have you thought

865
30:31.172 --> 30:32.412
about what to do in the future?

866
30:34.331 --> 30:35.412
I haven't decided yet.

867
30:36.371 --> 30:37.172
Anyway, I won't

868
30:37.212 --> 30:38.212
work for anyone again.

869
30:38.331 --> 30:39.412
All these years of grinding

870
30:39.452 --> 30:40.531
have totally burned me out.

871
30:40.811 --> 30:42.452
I'll take a good rest first,

872
30:43.212 --> 30:44.692
and then see if I can

873
30:44.932 --> 30:45.771
open a little shop

874
30:45.972 --> 30:46.932
and do a small business.

875
30:49.492 --> 30:50.531
My sweetie,

876
30:51.811 --> 30:52.851
opening a shop,

877
30:53.771 --> 30:54.892
running a small business...

878
30:56.611 --> 30:57.051
Good idea.

879
31:04.452 --> 31:05.412
Are you part cat?

880
31:05.452 --> 31:06.571
Why do you sneak up on me?

881
31:06.851 --> 31:07.371
I'm sorry.

882
31:07.972 --> 31:09.131
I came to apologize to you.

883
31:10.331 --> 31:11.091
About the cleaning,

884
31:11.652 --> 31:12.771
I was out of line.

885
31:13.252 --> 31:14.051
That's in the past.

886
31:14.611 --> 31:15.252
And also,

887
31:15.571 --> 31:16.732
I was wrong last time too.

888
31:17.932 --> 31:18.452
I'm sorry.

889
31:19.212 --> 31:20.012
I shouldn't have

890
31:20.051 --> 31:21.051
judged you and Liu Bai.

891
31:21.212 --> 31:23.131
Is today an official apology tour?

892
31:24.172 --> 31:25.771
You actually made a fair point.

893
31:26.091 --> 31:27.452
I should be thanking you.

894
31:28.091 --> 31:30.012
You helped Liu Bai find his direction.

895
31:30.492 --> 31:31.371
He went to Beijing

896
31:31.371 --> 31:32.412
to study videography.

897
31:32.732 --> 31:33.331
When I was

898
31:33.371 --> 31:34.371
on a video call with him,

899
31:34.412 --> 31:35.371
it was the first time

900
31:35.412 --> 31:36.531
I'd seen him work so hard.

901
31:36.692 --> 31:37.291
I...

902
31:38.252 --> 31:39.131
I just want to say...

903
31:41.172 --> 31:42.452
You don't have to bear it all

904
31:42.452 --> 31:43.331
on yourself.

905
31:44.172 --> 31:45.212
Leaning on someone

906
31:45.892 --> 31:46.571
isn't that bad.

907
31:48.771 --> 31:49.531
I'm used to it.

908
31:49.611 --> 31:51.051
I have to handle everything myself.

909
31:51.291 --> 31:52.611
I can't trust others with it.

910
31:54.692 --> 31:55.492
Does that mean

911
31:55.771 --> 31:56.892
I've done a terrible job

912
31:57.371 --> 31:58.452
these past few days,

913
31:59.172 --> 32:00.212
and couldn't satisfy you?

914
32:00.972 --> 32:01.611
Not like that.

915
32:02.051 --> 32:02.892
So you're satisfied?

916
32:09.932 --> 32:10.531
Tell me.

917
32:11.811 --> 32:12.811
What's holding you back?

918
32:14.611 --> 32:16.212
I have Chestnut to take care of.

919
32:16.531 --> 32:17.811
The kid comes first.

920
32:17.972 --> 32:19.051
I think Chestnut and I

921
32:19.051 --> 32:19.932
get along great.

922
32:22.892 --> 32:23.531
Kang Long,

923
32:23.972 --> 32:25.531
there's something I need to tell you.

924
32:28.892 --> 32:30.412
What is it you want to tell me?

925
32:32.331 --> 32:34.091
Actually, I looked for you after that night,

926
32:34.892 --> 32:35.771
but couldn't find you.

927
32:36.571 --> 32:38.131
I flew straight to Germany next day

928
32:38.692 --> 32:40.131
and changed my contact info.

929
32:40.771 --> 32:41.777
Only came back this year.

930
32:44.571 --> 32:45.452
So, what is it?

931
32:47.492 --> 32:48.972
Before I tell you,

932
32:49.012 --> 32:50.531
let me ask you a question.

933
32:51.252 --> 32:52.811
All these years abroad, you...

934
32:55.412 --> 32:56.012
I'm so sorry.

935
32:56.212 --> 32:57.492
I really have to take this call.

936
32:59.051 --> 32:59.611
Go ahead.

937
32:59.692 --> 33:00.051
Okay.

938
33:02.771 --> 33:03.212
Hello?

939
33:03.531 --> 33:04.012
What's up?

940
33:07.091 --> 33:08.452
If he doesn't listen, spank him.

941
33:08.692 --> 33:09.571
He's tough as nails.

942
33:11.692 --> 33:12.771
Well, he does learn fast.

943
33:13.012 --> 33:13.851
After all, he's ten.

944
33:14.212 --> 33:14.851
Besides,

945
33:14.972 --> 33:15.531
he's my boy,

946
33:15.771 --> 33:16.972
smart like me.

947
33:17.492 --> 33:18.452
Then tell him

948
33:19.131 --> 33:20.212
Daddy will be back soon.

949
33:20.492 --> 33:21.172
Let him wait.

950
33:22.091 --> 33:22.851
Alright, bye-bye.

951
33:28.452 --> 33:29.091
Where'd she go?

952
33:29.892 --> 33:30.972
He has a kid?

953
33:31.252 --> 33:32.771
And the boy is already ten!

954
33:32.811 --> 33:33.811
Guess what that means?

955
33:34.051 --> 33:34.652
That means,

956
33:34.652 --> 33:35.172
when we...

957
33:35.652 --> 33:37.051
He was already a dad!

958
33:37.412 --> 33:38.051
A married

959
33:38.172 --> 33:38.771
scumbag!

960
33:39.732 --> 33:40.932
What if he got divorced

961
33:41.331 --> 33:42.492
when the kid

962
33:42.531 --> 33:43.611
was still little?

963
33:43.771 --> 33:44.892
Doesn't that make him worse?

964
33:44.932 --> 33:45.452
Look,

965
33:45.571 --> 33:46.571
he must've been so awful

966
33:46.611 --> 33:47.492
that his ex-wife

967
33:47.531 --> 33:48.331
divorced him

968
33:48.371 --> 33:49.371
right after the baby

969
33:49.371 --> 33:49.892
came.

970
33:50.492 --> 33:51.851
So clearheaded.

971
33:53.531 --> 33:54.131
What a shame.

972
33:54.652 --> 33:55.932
I thought this was going to be

973
33:55.972 --> 33:57.371
a sweet reunion story.

974
33:57.732 --> 33:58.371
Anyway,

975
33:58.492 --> 33:59.492
I'll never let him know

976
33:59.531 --> 34:00.531
that he's Chestnut's dad.

977
34:00.851 --> 34:02.131
Keep this a secret for me.

978
34:03.131 --> 34:04.452
Chestnut is used to living

979
34:04.492 --> 34:05.492
without a father.

980
34:05.732 --> 34:06.452
If a father

981
34:06.452 --> 34:07.492
suddenly shows up one day,

982
34:07.692 --> 34:08.772
it shouldn't be someone

983
34:08.812 --> 34:09.691
who already has a kid

984
34:09.746 --> 34:11.051
and can't give her his full love

985
34:11.051 --> 34:12.292
and attention as a shared dad.

986
34:13.211 --> 34:14.492
That's meaningless to Chestnut.

987
34:15.131 --> 34:15.932
You're right.

988
34:16.131 --> 34:17.651
Chestnut is doing just fine right now.

989
34:18.731 --> 34:19.332
Zi,

990
34:20.251 --> 34:21.492
what if he

991
34:21.812 --> 34:23.051
keeps pursuing you?

992
34:23.211 --> 34:24.651
I won't give him the chance.

993
34:24.892 --> 34:26.332
A player like him

994
34:26.412 --> 34:27.892
probably has kids all over the place.

995
34:33.051 --> 34:33.852
Where are you going?

996
34:54.571 --> 34:56.131
(Test Results &amp; Item Details) The latest test data for Jinghua

997
34:56.131 --> 34:56.892
(Pass &amp; Fail) is all right here.

998
34:57.332 --> 34:58.211
(Fail) As you can see,

999
34:58.211 --> 34:59.372
several indicators failed.

1000
35:00.131 --> 35:01.012
Mr. Lin admitted

1001
35:01.012 --> 35:02.251
that he let greed blind him,

1002
35:02.772 --> 35:04.812
cutting corners during production

1003
35:04.852 --> 35:05.651
for personal gain,

1004
35:06.091 --> 35:07.292
and swapped out the samples

1005
35:07.332 --> 35:08.131
last time.

1006
35:09.611 --> 35:10.812
Sorry to interrupt.

1007
35:12.091 --> 35:12.651
Honey,

1008
35:13.412 --> 35:14.292
it's an exec meeting.

1009
35:14.412 --> 35:15.251
You shouldn't attend.

1010
35:15.651 --> 35:16.171
Mr. Di,

1011
35:16.297 --> 35:17.251
she's Jiali's legal rep,

1012
35:17.251 --> 35:18.171
Yu Jianguo's daughter.

1013
35:18.492 --> 35:19.372
Yu Jianguo currently

1014
35:19.372 --> 35:20.691
lacks civil capacity,

1015
35:21.012 --> 35:21.852
so she is

1016
35:21.892 --> 35:23.611
accountable to the company for her father.

1017
35:23.691 --> 35:25.332
The new product about to launch

1018
35:25.972 --> 35:27.412
passed Jiali's quality inspection

1019
35:27.412 --> 35:28.131
so smoothly

1020
35:28.171 --> 35:29.332
and quickly.

1021
35:29.492 --> 35:30.571
Who on earth

1022
35:30.611 --> 35:31.731
signed off on it?

1023
35:32.091 --> 35:33.211
I'd like to know too.

1024
35:34.412 --> 35:34.972
Mr. Di,

1025
35:35.171 --> 35:35.972
what do you think?

1026
35:36.972 --> 35:38.731
Then let Mr. Lin explain

1027
35:39.051 --> 35:39.651
who

1028
35:39.651 --> 35:40.932
his accomplice inside Jiali was.

1029
35:40.972 --> 35:41.531
Okay.

1030
35:42.611 --> 35:44.731
Mr. Lin, please tell everyone

1031
35:45.131 --> 35:45.731
who helped you

1032
35:45.731 --> 35:47.012
bypass the quality check

1033
35:47.452 --> 35:49.611
to let this batch pass.

1034
36:08.332 --> 36:09.051
Ms. Zhang.

1035
36:14.611 --> 36:15.611
That's nonsense.

1036
36:17.972 --> 36:18.932
I'm sorry, Ms. Zhang.

1037
36:19.651 --> 36:20.492
Right now,

1038
36:21.292 --> 36:22.131
