1042
36:26.412 --> 36:26.972
all this time.

1043
36:27.012 --> 36:27.932
No personal favors.

1044
36:28.171 --> 36:29.211
You can't pin this on me!

1045
36:29.492 --> 36:30.772
Turning your back on me now?

1046
36:30.892 --> 36:32.012
That's dirty.

1047
36:32.091 --> 36:33.691
When you took a car from me back then,

1048
36:34.091 --> 36:35.731
