1097
38:03.211 --> 38:05.131
I couldn't believe it at first either.

1098
38:05.452 --> 38:05.932
But...

1099
38:08.812 --> 38:09.651
Let's have Mr. Lin

1100
38:09.691 --> 38:10.571
