1107
38:23.772 --> 38:25.731
Here are my personal bank statements.

1108
38:26.292 --> 38:28.772
(Jiangzhou Bank Transaction Details) The kickback transfers to Ms. Zhang

1109
38:29.531 --> 38:30.051
