1127
39:16.012 --> 39:17.412
Get out and assist with inquiries.

1128
39:20.492 --> 39:21.012
Ms. Zhang.

1129
39:25.452 --> 39:26.372
Thank you, Mr. Di,

1130
39:28.211 --> 39:29.531
